<option value="21.gif">男性9
<option value="non.gif">不明
</select>
　<a href="./nbsr.cgi?mode=list"><img src="http://wahhaman.3nopage.com/nbs/img/list.gif" width="31" height="9" border="0"></a>　<a href="./pup.cgi"><img src="http://wahhaman.3nopage.com/nbs/img/icon.gif" width="31" height="9" border="0"></a>　あなたのアイコンが登録できます</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td nowrap><b>文字の色</b></td>
<td nowrap>
<input type="radio" name="color" value="#005500"><font size="+1" color="#005500">▼</font>
<input type="radio" name="color" value="#550000"><font size="+1" color="#550000">▼</font>
<input type="radio" name="color" value="#550055"><font size="+1" color="#550055">▼</font>
<input type="radio" name="color" value="#555500"><font size="+1" color="#555500">▼</font>
<input type="radio" name="color" value="#555555"><font size="+1" color="#555555">▼</font>
